OL,3,ABurnham wants Neets report to be
OL,4,Awatershed moment, No 10 says, as Tories
OL,5,Acriticise welfare and tax proposals
OL,6,
OL,7,FPM Andy Burnham wants a review into UK
OL,8,Fyouth unemployment - published earlier
OL,9,F- to be a "watershed moment in how we
OL,10,Fthink about welfare and how we support
OL,11,Fyoung people", No 10 says
OL,13,FThe report, by Alan Milburn, proposes
OL,14,Fwidespread changes to tax, welfare and
OL,15,Feducation in a bid to get 440,000 young
OL,16,Fpeople into work by 2036
OL,18,FAlmost one million people aged 16 to 24
OL,19,Fare not in education, employment or
OL,20,Ftraining - a rate of 13%, which Milburn
OL,21,Fwants to fall to 5% within a decade
OL,23,APub: 17-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG3/40
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
