OL,3,AWoman who accuses Russell Brand of rape
OL,4,Asays prison message 'upsetting'
OL,5,
OL,6,F"I just felt for those women that stood
OL,7,Ftrial and everything they went
OL,8,Fthrough," she said.
OL,10,FLatter, 37, who has alleged she was
OL,11,Fraped by Brand when she was 16, was not
OL,12,Fa complainant in his recent criminal
OL,13,Ftrial and he denies her claims.
OL,23,APub: 17-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG9/40
