OL,3,AUkraine accuses Russia of targeting
OL,4,Arescue operation after 'double-tap'
OL,5,Astrike kills 72
OL,6,
OL,7,FVerified images posted in the days
OL,8,Fafter the attack show damage to
OL,9,Femergency vehicles and excavation
OL,10,Fequipment at the site.
OL,12,FThe State Emergency Service of Ukraine
OL,13,F(DSNS) told BBC Verify there were
OL,14,Fmultiple Russian strikes during the
OL,15,Frescue.
OL,23,APub: 17-NovQpppppppppppppppppppppG11/40
