OL,3,ATrump meets Modi and other world
OL,4,Aleaders in Philippines on first leg of
OL,5,AAsia trip
OL,6,
OL,7,FEarlier, a red carpet was rolled out
OL,8,Ffor Trump as he touched down at an
OL,9,Fairport in the Philippine capital,
OL,10,FManila
OL,12,FAfter his overnight stay in Manila,
OL,13,FTrump is due to fly to Shenzhen, China
OL,14,Fto attend a summit of Asia Pacific
OL,15,Fleaders and have nuclear talks with
OL,16,FChinese President Xi Jinping and
OL,17,FRussia's Vladimir Putin
OL,23,APub: 17-NovQpppppppppppppppppppppG13/40
